OL,5,G0200 Flipping Bangers
OL,6,     FCitroen XM: Gus has his eye on a
OL,7,     FCitroen XM that looks amazing -
OL,8,     Fbut it's in France. Will isn't
OL,9,     Fsure, but the engineering
OL,10,     Fchallenges win him over.
OL,11,G0300 Flipping Bangers
OL,12,     FAudi TT: Gus and Will find an Audi
OL,13,     FQuattro roadster than has seen
OL,14,     Fbetter days - it's full of
OL,15,     Fproblems, and hasn't been serviced
OL,16,     Fin years. Even so, they are intent
OL,17,     Fon renovating it.
